Package: footbet
Title: European Football Betting Analytics with Sharp Odds
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("John", "Gavin", email = "john.b.gavin@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Download, process, and model European football match data and
    sharp bookmaker odds (Pinnacle). Implements Poisson/Dixon-Coles models,
    Elo ratings, and Kelly-criterion staking for value betting on full-time
    and half-time outcomes.
